WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.861
Round the far side.

00:02.561 --> 00:04.183
They did not land.

00:04.633 --> 00:18.324
Their ship swung once round the far side of the Moon, the side we never see from home, and at its farthest it was more than four hundred and six thousand kilometres from the Earth, further than Apollo 13.

00:18.774 --> 00:21.684
No people had ever been so far away.
